"common.creatorlinks.textcontent.othermeproductspage" : "\u201eServiceDesk Plus\u201c suteikia administratoriui galimyb\u0119 prid\u0117ti organizacijai nauding\u0173 i\u0161orini\u0173 nuorod\u0173. Tokiu b\u016bdu vartotojai gali pasiekti \u012fvairi\u0173 internetini\u0173 ar pasirinktini\u0173 taikom\u0173j\u0173 program\u0173, kurias administratorius prideda per \u201eServiceDesk Plus\u201c taikom\u0105j\u0105 program\u0105.",
